<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gillette resumed by Salomon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gillette resumed by Salomon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc said on Tuesday it resumed coverage of Gillette Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Diana Temple said in a research note her 1997 earnings estimate was $2.55 per share and her 1998 earnings estimate was $2.95 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;After a transition year in 1997, with inventory reduction in blades, reduced distributor sales at Duracell and flatness at Braun, we expect accelerated sales growth,&quot; she said. &quot;Gillette remains the most prolific new product company in our personal care universe...&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 2-3/4 at 85-3/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
